fFunction}_S(G,f,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\land G=f\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}graph\\text{-}of\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet12GraphOfFunction}_S(G,f,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\land G=f\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Functions are already set-coded graphs in the canonical function predicate; equality excludes non-pair junk that the former biconditional left unconstrained.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G,f,A,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12GraphOfFunction}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}graph\\text{-}of\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet12GraphOfFunction}_S(G,f,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\land G=f","display":true}],"bytes":877,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3427","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-set12-graph-of-function.md|58-df-zfc-set12-graph-of-function]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751"]}